    {
      "subId": "1202205",
      "subQuestName": "Go to the designated place",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120220501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120220501": {
            "id": "120220501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa... Look at all these petitions.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220502"
            ]
          },
          "120220502": {
            "id": "120220502",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So does Kokomi make time to deal with these even when she's resting?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220503"
            ]
          },
          "120220503": {
            "id": "120220503",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Sangonomiya Events Cash Flow Statement,\" \"Consolidated Annual Report on Fishing Production,\" \"Watatsumi Island Monthly Maintenance Expenses Breakdown\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220504"
            ]
          },
          "120220504": {
            "id": "120220504",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This is a lot of work for one person. And it's on top of all the directives she has to write and the people she has to meet day-to-day. It's no wonder she gets burnt out from time to time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220505"
            ]
          },
          "120220505": {
            "id": "120220505",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let's track down that book and help her feel like herself again!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1202208",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Kokomi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "120220204"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "120220204": {
            "id": "120220204",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Kokomi!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220205"
            ]
          },
          "120220205": {
            "id": "120220205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "So this is where you ran off to! We were gonna meet up and get things ready for the Victory Feast today, what happened?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220206"
            ]
          },
          "120220206": {
            "id": "120220206",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "Oh... It's you...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220207"
            ]
          },
          "120220207": {
            "id": "120220207",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "I—I apologize... I'm not feeling my usual self today.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220208"
            ]
          },
          "120220208": {
            "id": "120220208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "*gasp* You got sick? We'll go find a doctor right away!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220209"
            ]
          },
          "120220209": {
            "id": "120220209",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "No no, it's nothing like that... It's just, my energy is completely spent.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220210"
            ]
          },
          "120220210": {
            "id": "120220210",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Y—You run on energy? *gasp* You mean... you're like a Ruin Guard!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220211"
            ]
          },
          "120220211": {
            "id": "120220211",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "No, it's just a figure of speech. *sigh* I'm ashamed to admit it, but I can't always be the infinitely capable person I present myself as.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220214"
            ]
          },
          "120220214": {
            "id": "120220214",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "Oh... you noticed? I guess I haven't quite mastered the ability to hide how I'm feeling. I'll keep working at it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220215"
            ]
          },
          "120220215": {
            "id": "120220215",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "To be honest, I'm not really cut out to be a leader. At first, my dream was to read up on military strategy and perhaps become an adviser.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220216"
            ]
          },
          "120220216": {
            "id": "120220216",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "Constantly communicating with people, trying to retain their morale, having to read between the lines, making sure everyone gets the recognition they deserve... It's such hard work.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220217"
            ]
          },
          "120220217": {
            "id": "120220217",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "You're somehow supposed to make people feel wonderful just from being in your presence, while also commanding their respect... It doesn't come naturally to me. Truth be told, it's something I never wanted for myself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220218"
            ]
          },
          "120220218": {
            "id": "120220218",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "But because of my bloodline, I was always going to end up being the Divine Priestess sooner or later. Like it or not, it's just the way it is.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220219"
            ]
          },
          "120220219": {
            "id": "120220219",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "So whenever I feel overwhelmed, I come here to just lose myself in a book and relax for a while...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220220"
            ]
          },
          "120220220": {
            "id": "120220220",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "Don't worry, it doesn't affect my work. I handed over preparations for the Victory Feast to someone else.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220221"
            ]
          },
          "120220221": {
            "id": "120220221",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "I have to make a speech tonight, and I mustn't give the troops any reason to suspect that something could be wrong. This peace was hard-won, and I want them to feel at ease.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220222"
            ]
          },
          "120220222": {
            "id": "120220222",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is there anything we can do to help?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220223"
            ]
          },
          "120220223": {
            "id": "120220223",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "I should be feeling energized again soon if I hold off on work for a little longer. *sigh* If only there were some way I could listen to a good read on military strategy, I'm sure that'd speed up the process...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220224"
            ]
          },
          "120220224": {
            "id": "120220224",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "I was reading a book last time I was here, but I only got about halfway through. Where did I put it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220225"
            ]
          },
          "120220225": {
            "id": "120220225",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We'll find it for you!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220226"
            ]
          },
          "120220226": {
            "id": "120220226",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And then we'll read it out to you — to help you recover!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220227"
            ]
          },
          "120220227": {
            "id": "120220227",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "You'd do that for me? Thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "120220228"
            ]
          },
          "120220228": {
            "id": "120220228",
            "speakerId": 1037,
            "speakerName": "Sangonomiya Kokomi",
            "text": "Hehe... I'm really lucky you came back to Watatsumi Island."
          }
        }
      }
    },
